-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 42 of them. In 2025 on the middle, February to March ran 262% of normal and October to November ran 47%. Grid 7628 had its driest year in 2011 at 43%.</p>"}
